# ADK evaluation loop

This is the main iteration phase. Start with 1–2 eval cases, run `agents-cli eval run`, then change the agent and rerun until satisfied. Expect 5–10+ iterations.

Once you have a baseline:

- `agents-cli eval compare` — regression diffs between grade-results files
- `agents-cli eval analyze` — cluster failure modes
- `agents-cli eval optimize` — auto-tune prompts from eval data

Related commands: `agents-cli eval dataset synthesize`, `agents-cli eval generate` / `agents-cli eval grade`, `agents-cli eval metric list`. See the Evaluation Guide for metrics, dataset schema, LLM-as-judge config, and common gotchas.
